    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1098">

                <pb facs="0922" n="806" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg806"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/324.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Ambassador</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-01T16:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 1, 1912—4 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your April 30, 10 p.m. Since the <hi rendition="#italic">Buford</hi> sailed the
                    British Embassy here has requested that British subjects be assisted when
                    possible. <pb facs="0923" n="807" xml:id="pg807"/> Department replied that if
                    there is room after Americans have been cared for <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Buford</hi> will be glad to extend assistance to British subjects, and has
                    so instructed the <hi rendition="#italic">Buford</hi>. You may inform the
                    Americans who approached you and the consulates on the west coast that
                    Department will endeavor to have <hi rendition="#italic">Buford</hi> similarly
                    instructed regarding Spaniards and refugees of other nationalities.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Huntington Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
